# .stow-local-ignore
#
# ags/@girs and ags/node_modules used to be listed here so stow skipped them,
# but they are now stowed like everything else: their symlinks are relative,
# which GNU Stow accepts (it aborts only on ABSOLUTE symlinks).
#
# This file's mere existence overrides stow's built-in default ignore list
# (which would otherwise skip top-level README/LICENSE/COPYING and VCS dirs).

# Machine-local Claude Code state — belongs to the repo checkout, not ~/.config
\.claude
